          { "text": "She chairs the Senate Revenue Committee.", "cites": [1] }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Her Family Justice Center Act creates centralized service centers for survivors of violence and trafficking. She sponsored legislation blocking authorities from aiding other states’ investigations into reproductive care sought in Illinois. She also sponsored a bill shielding the medical records of patients traveling to Illinois for abortions. She negotiated a property tax reform bill allowing homeowners to keep surplus equity after delinquent tax sales. She advocated for a bill to ban civil immigration arrests in state courthouses.",
